            Lambda_Prod[Lambda Functions]
        end
        
        SP -->|Discount Applied Automatically| EC2_Dev
        SP -->|Discount Applied Automatically| Fargate_Prod
        SP -->|Discount Applied Automatically| Lambda_Prod
    end
